      "text": "All right, so across from the longest side is a 90 -degree angle.",
      "start": 167.504,
      "end": 172.314,
      "audio_length_seconds": 4.81,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 4.28,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0074.wav",
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Good thing I've got a 90 -degree dangle!",
      "start": 173.454,
      "end": 175.604,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.15,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.98,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0075.wav",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Joel, stop it!",
      "start": 176.224,
      "end": 177.674,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.45,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.45,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0076.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "You will never beat Troy!",
      "start": 177.674,
      "end": 179.624,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.95,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.95,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0077.wav",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "Why are you trying to be like Troy?",
      "start": 179.624,
      "end": 181.914,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.29,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.29,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0078.wav",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Dick!",
      "start": 181.914,
      "end": 183.284,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.37,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.61,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0079.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Add two, nerdy girl.",
      "start": 184.324,
      "end": 186.114,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.79,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.46,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0080.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "So, the hypotenu - What the f*** is going on?",
      "start": 186.114,
      "end": 196.824,
      "audio_length_seconds": 10.71,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 9.67,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0081.wav",
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "I'm an abysmal dance!",
      "start": 196.824,
      "end": 199.114,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.29,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.29,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0082.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "I'm going to miss my fans right here.",
      "start": 199.114,
      "end": 201.564,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.45,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.45,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0083.wav",
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Oh, my God!",
      "start": 201.564,
      "end": 203.074,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.51,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.51,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0084.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "Good evening, my fellow Americans.",
      "start": 208.094,
      "end": 209.964,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.87,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.71,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0085.wav",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Every day, our citizens improve the lives of those around them.",
      "start": 210.234,
      "end": 213.704,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.47,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 3.25,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0086.wav",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Today, we honor Troy Morrison.",
      "start": 213.854,
      "end": 215.964,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.11,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.0,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0087.wav",
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Now, Troy was in geometry class when his teacher mentioned the hypotenuse of a triangle.",
      "start": 216.054,
      "end": 221.304,
      "audio_length_seconds": 5.25,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 5.2,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0088.wav",
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Troy said, I wish I was high on potenus.",
      "start": 221.514,
      "end": 224.024,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.51,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.2,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0089.wav",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "That really cracked me up, and it cracked up the rest of America, too.",
      "start": 224.424,
      "end": 228.314,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.89,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 3.66,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0090.wav",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "So today, I'm pleased to present Troy with the Congressional Comedy Medal of Honor.",
      "start": 228.314,
      "end": 233.824,
      "audio_length_seconds": 5.51,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 5.45,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0091.wav",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Troy, on behalf of the entire country, I just want to, uh, thank you for your fantastic off -the -cuff line.",
      "start": 233.824,
      "end": 242.174,
      "audio_length_seconds": 8.35,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 8.22,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0092.wav",
      "word_count": 21
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "You are a true comedy hero.",
      "start": 242.174,
      "end": 244.824,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.65,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.98,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0093.wav",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Thank you, sir.",
      "start": 244.824,
      "end": 245.694,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.87,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.65,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0094.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "start": 246.114,
      "end": 246.804,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.69,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.52,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0095.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "And also, Mr. President, I have something for you.",
      "start": 246.804,
      "end": 249.374,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.57,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.33,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0096.wav",
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "What's that?",
      "start": 249.374,
      "end": 250.004,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.63,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.59,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0097.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Oh, he got one!",
      "start": 250.004,
      "end": 253.634,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.63,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.03,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0098.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Yes!",
      "start": 253.634,
      "end": 254.864,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.23,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.23,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0099.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "These are sold out.",
      "start": 254.864,
      "end": 256.304,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.44,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.4399,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0100.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "I haven't been able to get my hands on one of these.",
      "start": 256.304,
      "end": 258.216,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.912,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.9121,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0101.wav",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Thanks, Troy.",
      "start": 258.216,
      "end": 259.126,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.91,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.9099,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0102.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Oh, my God.",
      "start": 259.126,
      "end": 260.31,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.184,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.1841,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0103.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "I don't buy this.",
      "start": 260.31,
      "end": 261.98,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.67,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.67,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0104.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Have you ever found yourself in High Point, North Carolina and not feeling safe?",
      "start": 261.98,
      "end": 266.35,
      "audio_length_seconds": 4.37,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 4.37,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0105.wav",
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "It's going to be for you.",
      "start": 266.35,
      "end": 267.62,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.27,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.27,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0106.wav",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Heh.",
      "start": 267.62,
      "end": 267.83,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.21,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0107.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Aaaaah.",
      "start": 270.84,
      "end": 271.49,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.65,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.65,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0108.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Because that's lunacy, okay, do you understand?",
      "start": 272.93,
      "end": 275.54,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.61,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.61,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0109.wav",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "No!",
      "start": 275.63,
      "end": 275.94,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.31,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.5,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0110.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Make it rain!",
      "start": 276.23,
      "end": 277.16,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.93,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.93,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0111.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "I try to make it laugh.",
      "start": 277.81,
      "end": 279.24,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.43,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.43,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0112.wav",
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Are you serious?",
      "start": 279.91,
      "end": 281.2,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.29,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.29,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0113.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "This is bulls**t. Do not cut my balls off on this one!",
      "start": 281.2,
      "end": 286.85,
      "audio_length_seconds": 5.65,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 5.65,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0114.wav",
      "word_count": 12
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "start": 286.85,
      "end": 287.56,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.71,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.71,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0115.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Oh!",
      "start": 287.56,
      "end": 288.57,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.01,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.01,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0116.wav",
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "I totally love my nails right now.",
      "start": 289.38,
      "end": 292.17,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.79,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.79,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0117.wav",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "That's what you call a booty investment.",
      "start": 292.17,
      "end": 293.96,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.79,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.79,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0118.wav",
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Ha ha!",
      "start": 294.13,
      "end": 294.72,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.59,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.59,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0119.wav",
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Brothers, brothers, brothers.",
      "start": 294.72,
      "end": 296.37,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.65,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.65,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0120.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Tackle and grapple!",
      "start": 296.91,
      "end": 298.22,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.31,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.29,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0121.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "F**k you, Keegan.",
      "start": 298.22,
      "end": 300.124,
      "audio_length_seconds": 1.904,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 1.904,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0122.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "There he is.",
      "start": 300.124,
      "end": 300.694,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.57,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.57,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0123.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "That who is?",
      "start": 300.694,
      "end": 301.534,
      "audio_length_seconds": 0.84,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 0.84,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0124.wav",
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "For you, and y 'all, and your f***ing ears, y 'all.",
      "start": 301.534,
      "end": 305.024,
      "audio_length_seconds": 3.49,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 3.49,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0125.wav",
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Beacon, seriously, I'm done.",
      "start": 305.024,
      "end": 307.874,
      "audio_length_seconds": 2.85,
      "embedding_audio_seconds": 2.74,
      "audio_file": "audio\\sentence_0126.wav",
      "word_count": 4
    }
  ]
}